          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 1.1: Let us think and write"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.77,
            0.728,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Write about a similar problem that you tried to solve."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.796,
            0.43,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " What steps did you take?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.822,
            0.743,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Science is not just about memorising facts and figures or doing experiments. It is about following a step-by-step process that helps us find answers to our questions. So what are the steps that we can follow?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
